{{!
    @template mod_classprogress/log_session

    The title of a session in a table of the log page: for a planned session, a <details> that opens to show its block,
    hours and plan; below md, the block under it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasplan - Whether the session is planned.
    * title, block, hours - As typed, escaped here; hours empty when unknown.
    * content - The plan, already through format_text().

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasplan": true,
        "title": "Entorn",
        "block": "RA1 · Reconeix els elements",
        "hours": "2",
        "content": "<ul><li>Instal·lació de l'IDE</li></ul>"
    }
}}
{{#hasplan}}
    <details>
        <summary>{{title}}</summary>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-1">{{#hours}}{{hours}} h{{#block}} · {{/block}}{{/hours}}{{block}}</p>
        {{{content}}}
    </details>
    {{#block}}<div class="d-md-none small text-muted">{{block}}</div>{{/block}}
{{/hasplan}}
{{^hasplan}}
    {{title}}
{{/hasplan}}
